enjoyed the movie
for some reason it did not /hit/ as hard as I was expecting.
It did me a minute (not literal ofc, a very large minute) to identify the fourth titular junkie.
Watching this in the cinema would have been an insane experience hm.

Yeah, am surpried that the psychological horror did not scare me that much.
Also this is going to be such a dumb (note: finda better word for dumb) take, did tyrone had an oedipus complex or smth (ofc not), just reminiscing his good old days, right?

ok just looked wiki's first line: "psychological drama", yeah that makes perfect sense

hmm somehow i don't really have any more deep/interesting thoughts about the film, the music and the cinematography were nice and eerie, the old woman's character does make me worry about my own parents, and well more generally about myself as well in terms of loneliness and all.
Ig across the four characters the "characterisation" and "situations" (i'll probably forget what i meant by this; i meant like the character traits, like the old lady is lonely, with her son as her treasure, meanwhile the guy dearly loves both his mother, and his girlfriend, and well his friend, so he's not lonely, and like tyrone(the black dude) yearns for her mother i suppose, and like the girl fell from the grace of her well-to-do parents) were pretty well distributed.
Oh right, what a piece of shit junkie scum thing to put your mother (or as a matter of fact, anyonte) to put through.

I should mention specifically that the music track was absolutely terrific and haunting.

OH and also wtf, this was basically my first experience to jared leto, why tf does he look like Walter White Jr. (RJ Mitte) :cri: , that made me so confused

I do lowkey want to read the original novel, how could the writer have "written" a film as dynamic as this as a book ?

ig I gotta stop watching films coz they are "good films" because then i start expecting the director and producer to personnal  massage my heart and inject raw dopamine adrenalin and cortisol straight into my bloodstream all at once lmao

Oh and also, did the host stop mentioning her (sara's) smile in the later hallucinations ?
